{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "source_image_sha256": "588b4288e4c737dc489d2b9bc0652cca85e3d668b1784942ef4b4bda916f1005",
  "scenes": [
    {
      "chapter": 304,
      "source": "ADV/DAT/CHAPTER304.YBC",
      "sha256": "8651d7ad831086c1a00022fe297f5fc06f5121391ca4f77538e6593923ab7859",
      "text_count": 100,
      "pages": [
        {
          "chapter": 304,
          "source_offset": 118,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            0
          ],
          "text": "……這裡也完全沒有改變呢。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 304,
          "source_offset": 136,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            1
          ],
          "text": "……是的。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 304,
          "source_offset": 160,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            2,
            3
          ],
          "text": "想不到在這裡會受到「灰白」的歡迎，\n真是令人感到眼花撩亂哪。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 304,
          "source_offset": 262,
          "speaker_id": 16,
          "speaker": "格列佛 ",
          "text_indices": [
            4
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 304,
          "source_offset": 304,
          "speaker_id": 17,
          "speaker": "柏爾德",
          "text_indices": [
            5
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 304,
          "source_offset": 342,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            6
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 304,
          "source_offset": 368,
          "speaker_id": 16,
          "speaker": "格列佛 ",
          "text_indices": [
            7
          ],
          "text": "……你究竟是誰？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 304,
          "source_offset": 394,
          "speaker_id": 17,
          "speaker": "柏爾德",
          "text_indices": [
            8
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 304,
          "source_offset": 438,
          "speaker_id": 16,
          "speaker": "格列佛 ",
          "text_indices": [
            9,
            10,
            11,
            12
          ],
          "text": "明明就應該是賢者的你，\n為什麼會跑來這種地方……？\n經過了九年的旅行，\n難道你連正邪都沒有辦法分辨了嗎？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 304,
          "source_offset": 464,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            13
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 304,
          "source_offset": 486,
          "speaker_id": 16,
          "speaker": "格列佛 ",
          "text_indices": [
            14
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 304,
          "source_offset": 508,
          "speaker_id": 17,
          "speaker": "柏爾德",
          "text_indices": [
            15
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 304,
          "source_offset": 546,
          "speaker_id": 16,
          "speaker": "格列佛 ",
          "text_indices": [
            16,
            17,
            18
          ],
          "text": "為什麼你有辦法來這被異形混沌所包圍的玄室\n？\n我會依照你的答案來決定要不要殺你……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 304,
          "source_offset": 572,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            19
          ],
          "text": "……格列佛、柏爾德。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 304,
          "source_offset": 598,
          "speaker_id": 16,
          "speaker": "格列佛 ",
          "text_indices": [
            20
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 304,
          "source_offset": 620,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            21
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 304,
          "source_offset": 642,
          "speaker_id": 17,
          "speaker": "柏爾德",
          "text_indices": [
            22
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 304,
          "source_offset": 680,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            23,
            24,
            25
          ],
          "text": "如果要這樣說的話。\n你們兩個在這裡不但沒有東西可以吃，\n也沒有生火取暖……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 304,
          "source_offset": 710,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            26,
            27,
            28
          ],
          "text": "究竟又是為什麼有辦法保持著對我揮劍的體力\n呢？\n這難道不是也十分地不可思議嗎。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 304,
          "source_offset": 736,
          "speaker_id": 16,
          "speaker": "格列佛 ",
          "text_indices": [
            29
          ],
          "text": "這裡跟以前不一樣了呀。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 304,
          "source_offset": 768,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            30,
            31
          ],
          "text": "原來如此。\n原來這裡已經跟九年前不一樣啦。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 304,
          "source_offset": 794,
          "speaker_id": 16,
          "speaker": "格列佛 ",
          "text_indices": [
            32
          ],
          "text": "……請你不要轉移話題的焦點……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 304,
          "source_offset": 820,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            33
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 304,
          "source_offset": 842,
          "speaker_id": 16,
          "speaker": "格列佛 ",
          "text_indices": [
            34
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 304,
          "source_offset": 864,
          "speaker_id": 17,
          "speaker": "柏爾德",
          "text_indices": [
            35
          ],
          "text": "……哥哥。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 304,
          "source_offset": 890,
          "speaker_id": 16,
          "speaker": "格列佛 ",
          "text_indices": [
            36
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 304,
          "source_offset": 922,
          "speaker_id": 17,
          "speaker": "柏爾德",
          "text_indices": [
            37,
            38
          ],
          "text": "這個人……\n不是自己一個人過來的。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 304,
          "source_offset": 948,
          "speaker_id": 16,
          "speaker": "格列佛 ",
          "text_indices": [
            39
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 304,
          "source_offset": 970,
          "speaker_id": 17,
          "speaker": "柏爾德",
          "text_indices": [
            40
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 304,
          "source_offset": 992,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            41
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 304,
          "source_offset": 1030,
          "speaker_id": 16,
          "speaker": "格列佛 ",
          "text_indices": [
            42,
            43,
            44
          ],
          "text": "難道……？\n不，不可能。\n伊諾森提雅並沒有這麼強大的力量呀。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 304,
          "source_offset": 1100,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            45
          ],
          "text": "……格列佛。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 304,
          "source_offset": 1118,
          "speaker_id": 9,
          "speaker": "伊里安",
          "text_indices": [
            46
          ],
          "text": "柏爾德……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 304,
          "source_offset": 1172,
          "speaker_id": 17,
          "speaker": "柏爾德",
          "text_indices": [
            47
          ],
          "text": "伊里安……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 304,
          "source_offset": 1226,
          "speaker_id": 16,
          "speaker": "格列佛 ",
          "text_indices": [
            48
          ],
          "text": "瑟希利絲……！"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 304,
          "source_offset": 1248,
          "speaker_id": 17,
          "speaker": "柏爾德",
          "text_indices": [
            49
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 304,
          "source_offset": 1318,
          "speaker_id": 101,
          "speaker": "德涅西亞",
          "text_indices": [
            50
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 304,
          "source_offset": 1356,
          "speaker_id": 16,
          "speaker": "格列佛 ",
          "text_indices": [
            51,
            52,
            53
          ],
          "text": "不會吧……\n這真是太令人吃驚了……\n啊啊，您是……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 304,
          "source_offset": 1382,
          "speaker_id": 17,
          "speaker": "柏爾德",
          "text_indices": [
            54
          ],
          "text": "羽翼之長閣下……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 304,
          "source_offset": 1404,
          "speaker_id": 16,
          "speaker": "格列佛 ",
          "text_indices": [
            55
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 304,
          "source_offset": 1426,
          "speaker_id": 101,
          "speaker": "德涅西亞",
          "text_indices": [
            56
          ],
          "text": "……這真是令人開心呀。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 304,
          "source_offset": 1464,
          "speaker_id": 17,
          "speaker": "柏爾德",
          "text_indices": [
            57,
            58,
            59
          ],
          "text": "而且白銀的薔薇也在這哩，\n美麗的露弗鐸可勞千金呀……\n我一直都在為妳的平安祈禱呢。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 304,
          "source_offset": 1524,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            60,
            61
          ],
          "text": "……請兩位都把頭抬起來吧。\n我可不是你們應該低頭的對象唷？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 304,
          "source_offset": 1546,
          "speaker_id": 17,
          "speaker": "柏爾德",
          "text_indices": [
            62
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 304,
          "source_offset": 1568,
          "speaker_id": 16,
          "speaker": "格列佛 ",
          "text_indices": [
            63
          ],
          "text": "那麼……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 304,
          "source_offset": 1590,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            64
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 304,
          "source_offset": 1612,
          "speaker_id": 17,
          "speaker": "柏爾德",
          "text_indices": [
            65
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 304,
          "source_offset": 1634,
          "speaker_id": 16,
          "speaker": "格列佛 ",
          "text_indices": [
            66
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 304,
          "source_offset": 1662,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            67,
            68
          ],
          "text": "我一直都在等待，\n可以像這樣地再度跟大家聯手的日子。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 304,
          "source_offset": 1704,
          "speaker_id": 16,
          "speaker": "格列佛 ",
          "text_indices": [
            69
          ],
          "text": "……是的。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 304,
          "source_offset": 1722,
          "speaker_id": 17,
          "speaker": "柏爾德",
          "text_indices": [
            70
          ],
          "text": "……是的。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 304,
          "source_offset": 1760,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            71,
            72,
            73
          ],
          "text": "老師……\n身為純潔之盾之長，\n您願意認同他們兩個再度加入嗎？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 304,
          "source_offset": 1782,
          "speaker_id": 17,
          "speaker": "柏爾德",
          "text_indices": [
            74
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 304,
          "source_offset": 1804,
          "speaker_id": 16,
          "speaker": "格列佛 ",
          "text_indices": [
            75
          ],
          "text": "……雖然我們也是有一些躊躇。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 304,
          "source_offset": 1826,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            76
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 304,
          "source_offset": 1848,
          "speaker_id": 17,
          "speaker": "柏爾德",
          "text_indices": [
            77
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 304,
          "source_offset": 1886,
          "speaker_id": 16,
          "speaker": "格列佛 ",
          "text_indices": [
            78,
            79,
            80
          ],
          "text": "而且既然純潔之盾裡有著這樣的人物在支撐。\n看來純潔之盾之長，\n與我們所要追求的目標是一樣的。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 304,
          "source_offset": 1912,
          "speaker_id": 17,
          "speaker": "柏爾德",
          "text_indices": [
            81
          ],
          "text": "……至少現在我們的目標是一致的。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 304,
          "source_offset": 1934,
          "speaker_id": 16,
          "speaker": "格列佛 ",
          "text_indices": [
            82
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 304,
          "source_offset": 1996,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            83
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 304,
          "source_offset": 2018,
          "speaker_id": 17,
          "speaker": "柏爾德",
          "text_indices": [
            84
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 304,
          "source_offset": 2040,
          "speaker_id": 16,
          "speaker": "格列佛 ",
          "text_indices": [
            85
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 304,
          "source_offset": 2066,
          "speaker_id": 17,
          "speaker": "柏爾德",
          "text_indices": [
            86
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 304,
          "source_offset": 2110,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            87,
            88,
            89,
            90
          ],
          "text": "……灰白的雙星呀。\n用你們那熾烈燃燒的熱情，\n與如同寒冰一般堅定的信念，\n將一切都寄託在愛爾梅納斯的名號之下。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 304,
          "source_offset": 2152,
          "speaker_id": 16,
          "speaker": "格列佛 ",
          "text_indices": [
            91
          ],
          "text": "以這崇高的血統。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 304,
          "source_offset": 2170,
          "speaker_id": 17,
          "speaker": "柏爾德",
          "text_indices": [
            92
          ],
          "text": "以這崇高的血統。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 304,
          "source_offset": 2196,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            93
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 304,
          "source_offset": 2244,
          "speaker_id": 16,
          "speaker": "格列佛 ",
          "text_indices": [
            94,
            95
          ],
          "text": "向您發誓，要成為您作戰的劍，\n也成為保護您的盾。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 304,
          "source_offset": 2268,
          "speaker_id": 17,
          "speaker": "柏爾德",
          "text_indices": [
            96,
            97
          ],
          "text": "向您發誓，要成為您作戰的劍，\n也成為保護您的盾。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 304,
          "source_offset": 2300,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            98,
            99
          ],
          "text": "我相信……\n你們兩位的思念將會對純潔之盾有所幫助。"
        }
      ],
      "effects": [
        {
          "offset": 20,
          "opcode": 144,
          "operands": [
            16
          ]
        },
        {
          "offset": 28,
          "opcode": 144,
          "operands": [
            17
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "chapter": 305,
      "source": "ADV/DAT/CHAPTER305.YBC",
      "sha256": "1aecd46f664549ee4759313cda088ba2b540ee87c06c3ef0a1d709325babc6b1",
      "text_count": 40,
      "pages": [
        {
          "chapter": 305,
          "source_offset": 198,
          "speaker_id": 16,
          "speaker": "格列佛 ",
          "text_indices": [
            0
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 305,
          "source_offset": 240,
          "speaker_id": 17,
          "speaker": "柏爾德",
          "text_indices": [
            1
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 305,
          "source_offset": 284,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            2,
            3
          ],
          "text": "這樣啊……\n原來通往安蒂米昂的路已經被封鎖了嗎？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 305,
          "source_offset": 328,
          "speaker_id": 16,
          "speaker": "格列佛 ",
          "text_indices": [
            4,
            5,
            6,
            7
          ],
          "text": "我們在古雷那汀發現了那些負責封印道路的傢\n伙。\n但是就憑我們兩個人，\n連守住這玄室的大門也已經很困難了。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 305,
          "source_offset": 354,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            8
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 305,
          "source_offset": 376,
          "speaker_id": 16,
          "speaker": "格列佛 ",
          "text_indices": [
            9
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 305,
          "source_offset": 410,
          "speaker_id": 17,
          "speaker": "柏爾德",
          "text_indices": [
            10,
            11,
            12
          ],
          "text": "當然。\n如果沒有聖者之泉跟守護塔的話……\n我們大概也沒有辦法到達這裡吧。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 305,
          "source_offset": 440,
          "speaker_id": 17,
          "speaker": "柏爾德",
          "text_indices": [
            13,
            14,
            15
          ],
          "text": "總之，不管是要去哪裡，\n我們兩兄弟……\n最後都得待在不見天日的地方。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 305,
          "source_offset": 484,
          "speaker_id": 16,
          "speaker": "格列佛 ",
          "text_indices": [
            16,
            17,
            18,
            19
          ],
          "text": "……雖然說能夠逃到這個地方是很好啦，\n然而，在那之後卻被困在這裡面了。\n雖然現在已經沒事了，\n但還是感覺有一股無名火想要好好發洩一下。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 305,
          "source_offset": 506,
          "speaker_id": 17,
          "speaker": "柏爾德",
          "text_indices": [
            20
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 305,
          "source_offset": 600,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            21,
            22,
            23,
            24,
            25
          ],
          "text": "唉呀，這樣不是已經很好了嗎？\n就因為被困在這裡，\n才有辦法這樣地跟我們重逢。\n也是因為你們兩個都很努力，\n所以才有辦法生存到現在呀。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 305,
          "source_offset": 642,
          "speaker_id": 17,
          "speaker": "柏爾德",
          "text_indices": [
            26
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 305,
          "source_offset": 660,
          "speaker_id": 16,
          "speaker": "格列佛 ",
          "text_indices": [
            27
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 305,
          "source_offset": 698,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            28,
            29,
            30
          ],
          "text": "大家也都為了能跟你們兩個會合而感到開心。\n當然，我跟老師也很開心。\n……然後，接下來也就只有繼續前進了吧。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 305,
          "source_offset": 740,
          "speaker_id": 17,
          "speaker": "柏爾德",
          "text_indices": [
            31
          ],
          "text": "……是的。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 305,
          "source_offset": 758,
          "speaker_id": 16,
          "speaker": "格列佛 ",
          "text_indices": [
            32
          ],
          "text": "……是的。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 305,
          "source_offset": 836,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            33,
            34,
            35
          ],
          "text": "…………\n竟然可以在這裡存活兩個禮拜，\n你們兩位的實力真是令人期待呀。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 305,
          "source_offset": 858,
          "speaker_id": 16,
          "speaker": "格列佛 ",
          "text_indices": [
            36
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 305,
          "source_offset": 880,
          "speaker_id": 17,
          "speaker": "柏爾德",
          "text_indices": [
            37
          ],
          "text": "雖然力量微薄，但我們還是會全力以赴的。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 305,
          "source_offset": 902,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            38
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 305,
          "source_offset": 924,
          "speaker_id": 16,
          "speaker": "格列佛 ",
          "text_indices": [
            39
          ],
          "text": "因為這是我們兩個立下的誓約呀。"
        }
      ],
